        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但帕克斯也没丢发球局。两人一路保发，王欣瑜五比四领先，终于等来本盘第一个盘点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "818ed72898284091434a75c7fa7eac0e6aa55e449c6ffd9a5a22ce9941d16a8c",
