    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:299601b4eb32ecb649e4c30a936a8b439a066ee98cd3a4a8561f79682e9691c9",
      "request_id": "299601b4eb32ecb649e4c30a936a8b439a066ee98cd3a4a8561f79682e9691c9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4edba213fe044def1799d70af101f7b0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "轮到帕克斯八比七领先时，她迎来了第一个赛点。这次，比赛没有再给王欣瑜机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c7b5e6dd35921054fd62259d03dbd3da78b3b61f992b00ec15afa9bf66e0dbd8",
      "words_sha256": "6356d1e2fdb78593930ab84ad727c9fd24e5b77d3cf5843c6508d68584b465f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3514761c0125a1e55fdd4afe8b720c6b02685a67522746d81e988f46f2cac387",
      "request_id": "3514761c0125a1e55fdd4afe8b720c6b02685a67522746d81e988f46f2cac387",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0e61e094ec4d83dc54cc85f040028d02",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十六号上午，东京五百赛首轮。第一盘只拿一局，第二盘王欣瑜却三次只差一分，就能拖进决胜盘。这场失利，最可惜的是哪一步？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a8ca862346bb0ddaaa584cef023200e1fa14d35374970589fe2a0cdba8d4d155",
      "words_sha256": "dd63b94579b5511e6f3353ea09dd42c3daf0251c08cd1187163408dc556bd562"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4df01012e8099c1fd8c00d76677a142a44c5e8bf5c32cd8325c3e9475a7bcfea",
      "request_id": "4df01012e8099c1fd8c00d76677a142a44c5e8bf5c32cd8325c3e9475a7bcfea",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c41b17ba186f0a25fdc54960080d4b55",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘，最明显的变化，是王欣瑜守住了自己的发球局。她的二发得分，从首盘七分只拿一分，升到次盘十三分拿下十二分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6c4214f4952739894f8d69b90a539b108510fe437957aa0f1b7e59f9780874e4",
      "words_sha256": "a2081c24fe3eb0e5e04eb68bb342e98082515955e0c2f075ac21d9055987e14f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:58da6bdd0f5d3c4cf58f29915d022226d2f6f08dc700ea31b6b51fd721087d62",
      "request_id": "58da6bdd0f5d3c4cf58f29915d022226d2f6f08dc700ea31b6b51fd721087d62",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "779bc6fb41af1fd6edfa5b145acb8b0f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先看第一盘。帕克斯在底线左右调动，还能把防守的球顶回来。王欣瑜二发七分只拿一分，两次发球局失守，局面很快就被拉开。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "519b3af30059a42535aab49e445c8cfdd155d4889da082babc05287b74bdf8f2",
      "words_sha256": "239209b37eba5b97b5f67d03e8f7b166df0c905f4acca2e0f598bc49bc01fa06"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:63a7bc2cf55060bef83cff55e5096406219981d999670e87ca77fc8c0f4e15e9",
      "request_id": "63a7bc2cf55060bef83cff55e5096406219981d999670e87ca77fc8c0f4e15e9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a26de96fc873c5a66309dc60af51ad94",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "王欣瑜一比六、六比七，不敌帕克斯，东京首轮出局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "945af009186d0aa110e8b53a0932536eaa6516dfe00dc484416f274c61043c37",
      "words_sha256": "a66e11c94118fe3ae945ae6d6dfad23662eab30220a44c14c2f7ce71e43e817f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7306d651a6a642cc492cdacd800c0e27824d80b7fb312495a845a02f4826e968",
      "request_id": "7306d651a6a642cc492cdacd800c0e27824d80b7fb312495a845a02f4826e968",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3f1baeb292f2f5c936b56d8c896d5969",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "盘点到了。帕克斯往网前压，王欣瑜左右追球，还是没能拿下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "615ac22095a616c9c5ff1a96f378e394b46938ceb4aff2661770195aeffa728d",
      "words_sha256": "d1de64311676d83a6d64809486fe38021955fc2bcdc1341a69eb5d118e58ff21"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:80f6c93c88398509d6c17382ad43e49c60742f8d6573d74583af3e93b215dea8",
      "request_id": "80f6c93c88398509d6c17382ad43e49c60742f8d6573d74583af3e93b215dea8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c09f7bbca76783c34daed7a2aa616560",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从一比六打到三次盘点，抵抗是真实的。下一次，能不能把这份抵抗，变成一场胜利？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b32afb3f6e30c431aec641be7c95c1859631f16bba7da5112e0a8651aec4360f",
      "words_sha256": "042afe380b4345353fc1375b99a553b3274beb482365fd9a8ef4409fe1abb1ed"
    },
    {
