      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4edba213fe044def1799d70af101f7b0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "轮到帕克斯八比七领先时，她迎来了第一个赛点。这次，比赛没有再给王欣瑜机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "77cb84cc85b8a2e2bd978aa079de8a5333331e0b1adcb3748728b80892fe2466",
      "words_sha256": "36e1391253a4452ae66cbffceb1e7156f1674a222c609ac7750dfbd411a879fc",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e52fdf4921c09891116d9d2792b1ed2b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "全场制胜分，十比二十九。两盘下来，王欣瑜一次也没能破发。她把第二盘撑住了，却没能把机会变成胜势。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b32afb3f6e30c431aec641be7c95c1859631f16bba7da5112e0a8651aec4360f",
      "words_sha256": "042afe380b4345353fc1375b99a553b3274beb482365fd9a8ef4409fe1abb1ed",
      "words_path": "voice_25.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c09f7bbca76783c34daed7a2aa616560",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从一比六打到三次盘点，抵抗是真实的。下一次，能不能把这份抵抗，变成一场胜利？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
